{"id": "DeFTnCdMfC2", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "Manim \u2014 math animation written as Python.\n\nA scene is a Python class: create objects, then call play. Equations transform into each other, a grid bends under z\u00b2, odd sine waves add up to a square wave, and a torus turns into a sphere. Manim began as Grant Sanderson's own tool for the 3Blue1Brown videos; this is ManimGL from the 3b1b/manim repository, and the Community Edition is a separate fork.\n\nWe wrote and rendered these scenes ourselves with the library, apart from the repository's own TexTransformExample. No footage or characters from 3Blue1Brown videos are used.\n\nWhich idea would you rather explain with motion than with words?\n\nManim \u2014 Python\uc73c\ub85c \uc4f0\ub294 \uc218\ud559 \uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158.\n\n\uc7a5\uba74 \ud558\ub098\uac00 Python \ud074\ub798\uc2a4 \ud558\ub098\uc608\uc694. \uac1d\uccb4\ub97c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uace0 play\ub97c \ubd80\ub974\uba74 \uc218\uc2dd\uc774 \ub2e4\ub978 \uc218\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \ubc14\ub00c\uace0, \uaca9\uc790\uac00 z\u00b2\uc73c\ub85c \ud718\uace0, \ud640\uc218 \uc0ac\uc778\ud30c\uac00 \ub354\ud574\uc838 \uc0ac\uac01\ud30c\uac00 \ub418\uace0, \ud1a0\ub7ec\uc2a4\uac00 \uad6c\ub85c \ubc14\ub00c\uc5b4\uc694. Manim\uc740 Grant Sanderson\uc774 3Blue1Brown \uc601\uc0c1\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\ub824\uace0 \uc2dc\uc791\ud55c \ub3c4\uad6c\uc608\uc694. \uc601\uc0c1\uc740 3b1b/manim \uc800\uc7a5\uc18c\uc758 ManimGL\uc774\uace0, Community Edition\uc740 \ubcc4\ub3c4 \ud3ec\ud06c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc800\uc7a5\uc18c \uc608\uc81c TexTransformExample\uc744 \ube7c\uace0\ub294 \ubaa8\ub450 \uc800\ud76c\uac00 \uc9c1\uc811 \uc7a5\uba74\uc744 \uc4f0\uace0 \ub80c\ub354\ub9c1\ud588\uc5b4\uc694. 3Blue1Brown \uc601\uc0c1\uc758 \uc7a5\uba74\uc774\ub098 \uce90\ub9ad\ud130\ub294 \uc4f0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\ub9d0\ubcf4\ub2e4 \uc6c0\uc9c1\uc784\uc73c\ub85c \uc124\uba85\ud558\uace0 \uc2f6\uc740 \uac1c\ub150\uc774 \uc788\ub098\uc694?\n\n\ud83d\udcce Source / \uc6d0\ubcf8: Manim\nhttps://github.com/3b1b/manim/tree/fafa083a4fb274bba9cabde0b6e2f50ba6da0622\nOriginal creator / \uc6d0\uc791: Grant Sanderson / 3Blue1Brown LLC\n\u2733\ufe0e Code license / \ucf54\ub4dc \ub77c\uc774\uc120\uc2a4: MIT\nhttps://github.com/3b1b/manim/blob/fafa083a4fb274bba9cabde0b6e2f50ba6da0622/LICENSE.md\nCommunity Edition (separate fork / \ubcc4\ub3c4 \ud3ec\ud06c): https://github.com/ManimCommunity/manim\nCurated by @hyun2xyz", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1791139476, "like_count": 5036, "comment_count": 27, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1423198183122393a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 52.337, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM6TNf7QvMFb0iQ4YorxVWAPx6H_xVyuKM5Y_CKpUwMhy62E9QHvUCa_4ACZZEJCRIO9ABicMyXRjGbPeB_OolYgP1YUK-ZCminV0Y.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=R3qgHj4KbMQQ7kNvwED8Ovz&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=p9zf1YjIyPJyOMYSXVQMiQ&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQNFGGx4djq2iqV2eRrx1KSBGkx4Fvxp7Fbi0qBQzI4RHw&oe=6AE2060D", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 52.337, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.